    narr:narration """This hub tracks the operationalization of [decision capture at the point of consensus](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), a core product differentiator established in March 2026. By August 2026, the narrative shifted from conceptual definition to concrete delivery evidence, focusing on the [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785838678389_1) and the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785838678389_3). The trajectory reflects a transition from high-level product strategy to empirical validation, supported by [sprint-specific performance metrics](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785838678389_2) that frame the quarter's velocity as a marker of successful execution. The [inquiry into delivery evidence](narr:Position_Sprint4DeliveryEvidence) serves as the bridge between the initial design intent and these recent technical milestones.""" ;
